{"18":["<i>Pe’er</i> (“Glory”). Binah.","<i>Peh</i> (“Mouth”). Malkhut or Gedulah, Gevurah.","<i>Poked Avod</i> (“Who visits the sins” [Exod. 20:5]). Gevurah.","<i>Peter Reḥem</i> (“Firstborn”). Malkhut.","<i>Pele</i> (“Wonder”). Ḥokhmah.","<i>Peleg</i> (“Brook”). Binah, Malkhut.","<i>Panim</i> (“Face”). Tiferet.","<i>Pesak</i> (“Judgment”). Malkhut.","<i>Pekudah</i> (“Order”). Malkhut.","<i>Pekudim</i> (“Commandments”). Neẓaḥ and Hod.","<i>Pekidah</i> (“Visitation”). Malkhut.","<i>Parah</i> (“Calf”). Binah, Malkhut.","<i>Perat</i> (“Detail”). Tiferet.","<i>Peri ‘Etz</i> (“Fruit of Tree”). Malkhut.","<i>Periah</i> (“Uncovering” [in the context of circumcision]). Yesod or Malkhut.","<i>Parokhet</i> (“Curtain”). Malkhut.","<i>Parnas</i> (“Chief”). Binah, Malkhut.","<i>Peshuta</i> (“Simple”). Ḥesed. ","<i>Petaḥ</i> (“Gate”). Malkhut."]}
